        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>INOX RD110B, Stainless Steel 2-3/8 Inch Round Single Cylinder Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 2-3/8 Inch Stainless Steel Single Cylinder Deadbolt is for residential or light commercial use. It is made out of 304 grade stainless steel and is available in polished stainless steel, satin stainless steel, and oil rubbed bronze stainless steel finishes. A single cylinder deadbolt, it is locked and unlocked by a key from the outside and a thumbturn on the inside. The INOX RD Deadbolt will fit doors with 2-3/4 inch or 2-3/8 inch backsets that are 1-3/4 inches thick.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Round Single Cylinder Stainless Steel Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage C, 5-pin</li>\r\n<li>Fits most standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li>Concealed M5 thru-bolt installation.</li>\r\n<li>For residential or light-duty commercial applications.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Inox RD110B 2-3/8\" Diameter Stainless Steel Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Cast 304 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 19/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Rose Projection: 5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Thumbturn Width: 23/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt\" 1\" throw</i>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/INX-RD110B-specifications.pdf?v=1704262376\"><b>INOX RD110B Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/INX-Finish-3.jpg?v=1704354524\" width=\"600\" height=\"121\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Inox Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
